        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Données de SpamWise indisponibles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SpamWise includes the open-source software below. Their notices and licenses follow.\n\n**ClaudeForFoundationModels** (revision 0262e1a). Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.\n\n**SwiftNIO**, **swift-nio-imap**, **swift-nio-transport-services**, **swift-collections**, **swift-atomics**, **swift-system** and **swift-se0270-range-set**. Copyright Apple Inc. and the Swift and SwiftNIO project authors. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.\n\n**Public Suffix List**. Licensed under the Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0. Source: [publicsuffix.org](https://publicsuffix.org/list/).": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SpamWise incluye el software de código abierto que se indica a continuación. Después se reproducen sus avisos y licencias.\n\n**ClaudeForFoundationModels** (revisión 0262e1a). Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC. Con licencia Apache, versión 2.0.\n\n**SwiftNIO**, **swift-nio-imap**, **swift-nio-transport-services**, **swift-collections**, **swift-atomics**, **swift-system** y **swift-se0270-range-set**. Copyright Apple Inc. y los autores de los proyectos Swift y SwiftNIO. Con licencia Apache, versión 2.0.\n\n**Public Suffix List**. Con licencia pública de Mozilla, versión 2.0. Fuente: [publicsuffix.org](https://publicsuffix.org/list/)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SpamWise inclut les logiciels libres ci-dessous. Leurs mentions et licences suivent.\n\n**ClaudeForFoundationModels** (révision 0262e1a). Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC. Sous licence Apache, version 2.0.\n\n**SwiftNIO**, **swift-nio-imap**, **swift-nio-transport-services**, **swift-collections**, **swift-atomics**, **swift-system** et **swift-se0270-range-set**. Copyright Apple Inc. et les auteurs des projets Swift et SwiftNIO. Sous licence Apache, version 2.0.\n\n**Public Suffix List**. Sous licence publique Mozilla, version 2.0. Source : [publicsuffix.org](https://publicsuffix.org/list/)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SpamWise is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Anthropic. Claude is a trademark of Anthropic PBC.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SpamWise no está afiliada, respaldada ni patrocinada por Anthropic. Claude es una marca comercial de Anthropic PBC."
