    "This edition also includes **swift-log**, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; **GitHubUpdateChecker**, **swift-markdown-ui** and **NetworkImage**, licensed under the MIT License; and **swift-cmark**, licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License.": {
